  <para style="h">3 Johane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Gwebutatu gwaJohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johane</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Joh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Gwebutatu</para>
  <para style="mt1">gwaJOHANE</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lukwalo gwebutatu gwaJohane</char> gwakakwagwa ndiJohane pakati kwemakole ali makumi mahanu kunoti gulu hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu. Johane atozwitula senkwali, koga unozwidana eti uwhola, (3 Johane1.1). Unoyeta iko zwako muna (2 Johane 1.1). Kogagwamoyo kuti Johane wakakwala Ndebo mbuya sekwayakakwagwa ndiyo ndiJohane newhalo nhatu 1 Johane, 2 Johane, na 3 Johane etjagala kuEfesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo igogu Johane wakagukwalila nghalimoyo unoyi Gayiyasi. Unodana Gayiyasi senkwinya ewunlaya kuti awamutjile maKhirisitu amugwendo anopinda pabugalo gwaali.</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Johane unotula lukwalo gugwe (3 Johane 1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unokotjikuludzila Gayiyasi ewunlaya kuti awamutjile bagalimoyo ( 3 Johane 1.2-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tjinotebela, indebeleko nekwebalume babili, Diyothirefesi naDimethiriyasi ( 3 Johane 1.9-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tjebupelo unofidza lukwalo gugwe ( 3 Johane 1.13-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Kubva kuWhola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Kuna Gayiyasi ndhikani, wandinoda nelebeswa.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Ndhikani wangu, ndotembezelela kuti zwinhu zose zwikuyendile zwakanaka kakale ube nebutjilo gubuyanana, ndoziba kuti mumeya iyo kokuyendila zwakanaka. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Ngobe ndakahanha kwazo pakaswika amwe makamu epa busupi nekwelebeswa mubutjilo gugo, sekwawunotjila mulebeswa. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Akuna kumwe hanha kwandinako kunopinda ikoku, kuti ndiwhe kuti bana bangu banotobela malebeswa.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gayiyasi Unolumbidziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Ndhikani, nothama zwibuyanana hapa ubhatsha makamu kene nayipi zwayo zila, nekene usingawazibe. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Ibabo banhu bakapa busupi mbeli kwegubungano nekweludo gugo. Unowhoba uthama zwibuyanana hapa ubabhatsha mugwendo gwabo, ukuthama nezila inohanhisa Ndzimu. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />Ngobe kwakabe kuli ngentha yezina lile kuti babe negwendo kakale abazowamutjila tjimwe tjinobva kubasingagalemoyo. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Ndizo takafanila wahha banhu banonga ibaba, kuti tibe bahingi panhu pan'ompela nabo mulebeswa.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diyothirefesi naDimethiriyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Ndakakwalila gubungano lukwalo, koga Diyothirefesi, unoda zwisa mbeli, atowamutjila butungamili gwangu. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Ndizo pandinowhohha, ndowholeba kose kwaanothama, endigongobola nematama akayipa. Pehhugwi kwayikoko, unolamba wamutjila makamu, kakale unodzibisa ibabo banohaka bawamutjila ebatata mugubungano.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Ndhikani wangu, usiyedzelele bubi koga yedzelela tjakanaka. Unothama tjakanaka ndeweNdzimu; unothama bubi haanhu akabona Ndzimu.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Dimethiriyasi unolebgwa zwakanaka nenhu wose, kose nelebeswa tjekwalo lowunleba zwakanaka, nami bo ndopa busupi nekukwe, moziba kuti busupi gwangu gulebeswa.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyisa kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Ndinakunjinji kwandingakukwalila, koga andingakwale nelusiba nange inki. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Ndakalingilila kukumba nekulibilidza, ndipo patinowholebeleka takalingisana.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Kunyalala ngakube kukuli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Bakwinya banokubuyisa. Ubuyise bo bakwinya, umwe newumwe wabo.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>